      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Eleocharispusilla'Mini'(132BTC)/4571",
      "html": "<p>Plant the mini-version in small portions to cover a large area. In short time, a dense carpet will be obtained. Needs light to perform optimally, however, it is one of the most reliable species for creating a carpet – and requires a minimum of maintenance since the leaves remain short (3-5 cm).</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "tropica",
      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Eleocharispusilla'Mini'(132BTC)/4571",
      "html": "<p>Aquarium plant from tissue culture in closed cup. Eleocharis pusilla has even lower growth than the common Eleocharis parvula and was given to Tropica by Thomas Barr from USA. Suitable for nano-aquariums.</p>"
    }
